---

## 🌿 About Carevora

**Carevora** is an AI-powered elderly-care support platform designed to assist caregivers in monitoring the **emotional, cognitive, and metabolic well-being** of elderly residents.

The platform brings together **Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, conversational assessment, personalized risk prediction, Explainable AI, and caregiver decision support** within a unified web-based elderly-care system.

> ⚠️ **Important:** Carevora is an academic research and decision-support system. It is **not a medical diagnostic system** and does not replace professional healthcare services.

